Contact: nicolas@eurotech-federation.com

A note on history
-----------------

This repository was public and Apache-2.0 licensed until 2026-08-14. The Apache
grant is perpetual and irrevocable by its own terms, so any copy obtained before
that date remains under Apache-2.0 in the recipient's hands. The terms above
apply to this and every subsequent version. Changing repository visibility does
not, and cannot, withdraw a grant already made.
